### Get selectable TTS voices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tts/voices
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get company voice settings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/voice
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update voice settings
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/voice
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "speed": 1.0,
  "pitch": 0.0
}

### Preview a catalog voice (response is audio/wav)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tts/voices/zamira/preview
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "text": "Assalomu alaykum, men Uysot kompaniyasining virtual yordamchisiman."
}

### Try an STT provider on a recording (webm/opus, mp4, wav, mp3 — anything ffmpeg reads, up to 30 s)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stt/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< ./sample.wav
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="provider"

yandex
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

uz-UZ
--WebAppBoundary--
